      "name": "How much does personalized bedding from Jeminise cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The Family Bedding range has 16 products priced from $24.90 to $154.90. Fleece blankets start at $24.90, duvet covers at $34.90, sherpa blankets at $39.90, quilts at $46.90 and comforters at $64.90. The final price depends on the size and set option you choose."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What can I personalize on Jeminise bedding?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most products in the range, 14 of 16, offer two text fields. They're often used for two names, or a name and a date. Several designs also include a photo of the couple."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Jeminise personalized bedding machine washable?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Machine washable is stated on 15 of the 16 product pages in the Family Bedding range. Check the page for the specific product you're buying, and follow the care label for wash and dry settings."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes does personalized bedding come in?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Blankets come in 40\" x 30\", 50\" x 40\", 60\" x 50\", 80\" x 60\" and Throw (60\" x 70\"). Bed sizes include US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\") and US King (104\" x 88\"), plus Twin (68\" x 86\"), Full (80\" x 90\") and Queen (90\" x 90\"). Each product page lists the sizes that product comes in."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I get matching pillowcases?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Set options are no pillowcases, 1 pillowcase, 2 pillowcases, 2 pillowcases with 1 sheet, or 4 pillowcases. Every pillowcase is listed as 20\" x 30\"."
      }
    }
